  "id": "cognitive-coping",
  "term": "cognitive coping",
  "definition": "Cognitive coping is the use of thinking-based strategies to deal with difficult experiences such as chronic pain. In this context, it refers to matching a strategy to a person’s preferred coping style to help lessen pain intensity and situational anxiety.",
